pps/2885810/221154d1a2a3fafbc357cefc6965ab79d8bbe6db/ss_221154d1a2a3fafbc357cefc6965ab79d8bbe6db.600x338.jpg?t=1763079152"}],"short_description":"Pink Noise is a nonlinear visual novel in the psychological horror genre, immersing you in the retro atmosphere of the '90s. It tells the tale of a group of teenagers who unknowingly set off a chain of terrifying events. What secrets lie within the mysterious VHS tape they should\u2019ve never played?","steam_appid":2885810,"support_info":{"email":"sombergamesstudio@gmail.com","url":"https://www.sombergames.com/"},"supported_languages":"English, Russian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://www.sombergames.com/"}